==English==

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|rw|u Rwanda}} from the archaic verb {{m|rw|anda|-anda|to expand}}. Compare {{cog|zu|anda||to multiply}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|en|/ɹuˈændə/|/ɹəˈwændə/|/ɹəˈwɒndə/}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|en|/ɹuˈɑndə/|/ɹəˈwɑndə/}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-Rwanda.wav |Audio (Southern England)}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# {{senseid|en|Q1037}}{{place|en|country|r/East Africa}}.
